6:02Z\",\n    \"assets\": [\n\n    ],\n    \"tarball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/tarball/v26.32.0\",\n    \"zipball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/zipball/v26.32.0\",\n    \"body\": \"Thank you to all the contributors who made this release possible!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Features\\r\\n\\r\\n- add delete on error ([ab614203c](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/ab614203cb92e18c3d7ea62ce9cc2a06dd9c571a))\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Improvements\\r\\n\\r\\n- change icon for blocked users (@fehmer) ([#8289](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8289)) ([71a98fbb4](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/71a98fbb4c60d02d04e159d58bc0c9605bdc627e))\\r\\n- native support for number in InputField (@fehmer) ([#8197](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8197)) ([1c862b7a3](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/1c862b7a3b82ad85e8b38808de0588b774882d25))\\r\\n- **leaderboard:** scroll to top when using bottom navigation (@fehmer) ([#8204](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8204)) ([a7ee6c9be](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/a7ee6c9be33714fe25c213efcd2f4ff4c9ff007f))\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Fixes\\r\\n\\r\\n- delete on error hard sometimes not working at the end of a line ([48b656133](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/48b656133c0ff3e0968c723de240d136f7378bad))\\r\\n- errors when delete on error tries to go back to a word that was removed ([f8a0fafe1](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/f8a0fafe1ce877f3f8abc485578efbf9923b51fe))\\r\\n- unable to clear social profiles ([f0c57c5c1](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/f0c57c5c16df1347008e145d3a09ddf3987be7a9))\\r\\n- live stats mini alignment ([7be5afdfa](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/7be5afdfa4ea7b8681706db896b967b5164c4d84))\\r\\n- handle NaN case in fps limit submission (@charlielidstone) ([#8260](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8260)) ([f66eee249](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/f66eee249ee794479ace3539c6347953a2e8f8c1))\\r\\n- **command line:** input not working during show animation ([0b45e2b95](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/0b45e2b95daf0c95c86084cc033f3484c652314f))\\r\\n- invisible caret ([8f9241d6c](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/8f9241d6c4e9a9e36319603c6c9d4ce467ce439d))\\r\\n- **words-filter:** typo in invalid regex error (@Leonabcd123) ([#8241](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8241)) ([0e8cf3ef4](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/0e8cf3ef445a0aa83c61d6b25814d4fa50bdce25))\\r\\n- **quote-length-filter:** custom length filter modal not opening (@Leonabcd123) ([#8091](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8091)) ([d88f5efa0](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/d88f5efa0585a0d376f7c6b2a285b4c74e775f87))\\r\\n- **contact-modal:** modal refers to wrong page (@Leonabcd123) ([#8099](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8099)) ([2362bbbc0](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/2362bbbc0103404f2e6191fb9eed8f25e9181d7d))\\r\\n- accept non-breaking hyphen as a replacement for ascii hyphen ([7713c8d7a](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/7713c8d7ab9cc652943cdbd655eaef462610e480))\\r\\n- releases fetched multiple times (@fehmer) ([#8237](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8237)) ([c0882ec8e](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/c0882ec8ec1364866ce120c5c30e0a34de4ef331))\\r\\n- custom fonts not working (@fehmer) ([#8235](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8235)) ([96319852e](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/96319852e173d74271d440465c45321249e18ab6))\\r\\n- **stats:** derive tick count from actual timing values ([fb25c30fa](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/fb25c30fa037fa06d083cb5e9a2def0bd8d5c0e8))\\r\\n- inputField valiation broken after being empty (@fehmer) ([#8232](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8232)) ([90d038a81](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/90d038a8143aef3f9725fbf66dd0e3718590dba2))\\r\\n- **account:** missing test activity calendar (@fehmer) ([#8230](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8230)) ([f1b602973](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/f1b6029738b4843fd810fb7893d32db483bd0cd5))\\r\\n- google recaptcha challenge not reachable (@fehmer) ([#8226](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8226)) ([5c9528564](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/5c95285643cf4b2a262146603ffe21a0f216b06a))\\r\\n- **test:** opposite shift mode using wrong keymap (@fehmer) ([#8220](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8220)) ([781dcd9fe](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/781dcd9fe66fb4d8fb3f5e408d1b057a2054b9d5))\\r\\n- keymap next not working correctly ([9a1e6357d](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/9a1e6357d55b2ce76bf9000728e5fbbf56c6bd62))\\r\\n- **test:** missing average notice for quotes (@fehmer) ([#8201](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8201)) ([fc737e3f3](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/fc737e3f3a8bca503218cd28149e9cb5317bf610))\\r\\n- editing profile would break the account page ([b59ccdf68](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/b59ccdf6806914a2c8c673e5654c5349d59b96e0))\\r\\n- **settings:** prevent fps input from resetting (@Rajparikh18) ([#8130](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8130)) ([df809aa1c](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/df809aa1cd18d5b2f3a00d462a24930157e60ba9))\\r\\n- word jumping to 3rd line when overflowing (@nadalaba) ([#8210](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8210)) ([428e0f87b](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/428e0f87b71f38e21660abafda0e4088f1b2006a))\\r\\n- layout emulator broken after solidjs migration (@fehmer) ([#8207](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8207)) ([5687eeea5](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/5687eeea5cd96159c7e7d113d570747be9ac9c5d))\\r\\n- modal tab navigation when quick restart is set to tab not working correctly ([eec443292](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/eec443292ba99d1c91691c843e7d8bc934729e9d))\\r\\n- unable to clear social profiles ([e5433977e](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/e5433977e37824cb34ab39664b819b82cb711add))\\r\\n- merch banner showing out of stock keycap ([13bed942b](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/13bed942bb579a24ba13d1e7e25056fabda8a676))\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Nerd stuff\\r\\n\\r\\nThese changes will not be visible to users, but are included for completeness and to credit contributors.\\r\\n\\r\\n- allow languages to set specific fonts (@Shamsuddin45, @fehmer) ([#8208](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8208)) ([37bb96caf](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/37bb96cafbb03ffffe80960f2c28ddd2a088497a))\\r\\n- **refactor:** convert the rest of test state to solid (@miodec) ([#8261](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8261)) ([e113dff1c](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/e113dff1cfc27cc624f47ac9899d6e287c3fc33f))\\r\\n- **refactor(test restart):** move UI code to test-ui.ts (@miodec) ([#8255](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8255)) ([b5968f025](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/b5968f02527b02c30280cd023d7dad3b0ce15cf2))\\r\\n- **refactor:** solid live stats (@miodec) ([#8248](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8248)) ([476fe5e07](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/476fe5e0779f9ab02a84424501e6f2510333a4da))\\r\\n- **refactor:** convert activeWordIndex state to a solid signal ([9f7c1743b](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/9f7c1743b1e855ff5a63fbbd5c6a2f6d7a6f37de))\\r\\n- **refactor:** remove unnecessary time state, derive from from events (@miodec) ([#8242](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8242)) ([c65b1cd61](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/c65b1cd614260f64d7af56a4c9ba0215753823ad))\\r\\n- **refactor:** solid personal bests modal (@d1rshan) ([#8009](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8009)) ([25542572d](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/25542572da565fad716f9d879b81c49df3a3e124))\\r\\n- **refactor(test):** solid monkey (@fehmer) ([#8182](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8182)) ([f4cc210c1](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/f4cc210c18e825561f45bf4c3f5ac0f24c1bc8bc))\\r\\n- **refactor:** move test active state to a signal ([6068a2c58](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/6068a2c58f0ca5004e16cf530b4c1dd94265c80d))\\r\\n- **refactor:** prevent miniSnapshot to be set to db (@fehmer) ([#8215](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8215)) ([a8d473d79](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/a8d473d79275078f83cd59bc7804da844f1ffd14))\\r\\n- **refactor:** solid edit result tags modal (@fehmer) ([#8194](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8194)) ([caf2aa2e9](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/caf2aa2e9f1015a7f0121fb968ec46c43ff50425))\\r\\n- **refactor:** solid modals with recaptcha (@fehmer) ([#8187](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8187)) ([a224275a5](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/a224275a5dcfcc5af38aaa766c7fc1956d7fe537))\\r\\n- **refactor:** solid keymap (@fehmer) ([#8134](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8134)) ([9637ad15b](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/9637ad15b2fa2d2beb711c99b0cd72e2906105ed))\\r\\n- **ci:** use cache for format checking (@fehmer) ([#8297](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8297)) ([44d170160](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/44d170160ab2c466b6ab069994b7f96eaaee2019))\\r\\n- **ci:** fix format check pipeline (@fehmer) ([#8287](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8287)) ([8a39031ad](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/8a39031add0c93417551d2b92726828e15568eb8))\\r\\n- **ci:** run check assets if packages change (@fehmer) ([#8251](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8251)) ([974947571](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/974947571417386235ee093301fe53156cf3f4ec))\\r\\n- **ci:** run check assets if packages change (@fehmer) ([#8249](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8249)) ([4eec63c63](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/4eec63c6312ad3b164b49e748016363fc1497103))\\r\\n- **ci:** fix tsx only changes not triggering fe build (@fehmer) ([#8205](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/pull/8205)) ([27f323e00](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/27f323e00cb3437cefa8da19ea88c85e2b6d8393))\\r\\n- **chore:** bump oxc ([b9edfbebd](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/b9edfbebdb30fef2e7e32f9a7b04981742c52b42))\\r\\n- **chore:** why was this commented? ([25d72fdd9](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/25d72fdd9a04465bdad782483691dcf88bca4402))\\r\\n- **chore:** make sure to escape html ([94b97b8e1](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/94b97b8e19bb738d3a292127bd3eb1a8c951ae97))\\r\\n- **chore:** update oxc, add more rules ([7feea96c5](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/7feea96c5df21a59af9553fa7c52eb33af5997b8))\\r\\n- **chore:** revert debug change ([4a6449274](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/4a6449274f0af1f56a4787bdd8a30572f2064f8f))\\r\\n- **chore:** convert premid elements to solid ([73a059e20](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/73a059e20a2c48e683475b58e2b61c68c3387711))\\r\\n- **chore:** remove unused state ([8bd768e25](https://github.com/monkeytypegame/monkeytype/commit/8bd768e25e053dadb104d1d2b8e891a50de5f3ab))\\r\\